<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM says issues 10-yr DFl 300 mln bond.</title>
<headline>DSM says issues 10-yr DFl 300 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemicals group DSM NV said on Wednesday it had decided to issue a 10-year 300 million guilder debenture loan, and had appointed ABN AMRO Hoare Govett as lead manager.</p>
</text>
